  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.9,
   "text": "Tribe member born with furred nipple on forehead. Tribe call him Boobye. It okay though. He both watch",
   "avg_logprob": -0.245,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.025
  },
  {
   "start": 6.9,
   "end": 15.26,
   "text": "AND feed baby. But how happen? Let's start at start. You have body. Body follow instruction.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.245,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.025
  },
  {
   "start": 15.88,
   "end": 22.22,
   "text": "Like when hunt, me listen to leader, and not trislap, sleeping savortooth. Me do anyway.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.245,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.025
  },
  {
   "start": 22.48,
   "end": 29.54,
   "text": "Body instruction include hair, eye color, height, and other thing like anti-sick strength. Like",
   "avg_logprob": -0.245,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.025
  },
  {
   "start": 29.54,
   "end": 35.26,
   "text": "fighting invisible bug that crawl inside body and make hot liquid come out of holes.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.246,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.024
  },
  {
   "start": 35.98,
   "end": 42.72,
   "text": "Instruction also called genes. Genes inside invisible spinning string ladder called DNA.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.246,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.024
  },
  {
   "start": 43.36,
   "end": 48.84,
   "text": "Which mean deoxyribon- bone? Bone? Bone?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.246,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.024
  },
  {
   "start": 51.86,
   "end": 58.66,
   "text": "Sometimes though, instructions in string ladder wrong. Like cave baby born with eye that go",
   "avg_logprob": -0.246,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.024
  },
  {
   "start": 58.66,
   "end": 65.84,
   "text": "two way. One chase bird, other stare at those. A weird caveman who have orange hair. Call self",
   "avg_logprob": -0.183,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 65.84,
   "end": 74.24,
   "text": "ginger. Some call him target. So how fixed DNA ladder? Big brain man use magic gene edit tool",
   "avg_logprob": -0.183,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 74.24,
   "end": 82.9,
   "text": "called CRISPR. It allow them to look at ladder and spot the uh-oh bat pot. They then use tiny",
   "avg_logprob": -0.183,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 82.9,
   "end": 91.3,
   "text": "ladder robot handyman to cut bat pot. Then put string back together good. Or take out and put",
   "avg_logprob": -0.193,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.151
  },
  {
   "start": 91.3,
   "end": 98.92,
   "text": "new pot back in. Like how grug once say. He sad. So me say smile and make wish. Then me bonk grug",
   "avg_logprob": -0.193,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.151
  },
  {
   "start": 98.92,
   "end": 105.78,
   "text": "on head. And now grug no move or blink. But he smile forever. Me love grug. He listen good.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.193,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.151
  },
  {
   "start": 105.78,
   "end": 115.28,
   "text": "But what good can ladder string fix do? Many thing. It could fix bad muscle sick, HIV, or some cancer.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.512
  },
  {
   "start": 115.72,
   "end": 122.84,
   "text": "Big brain man could also make personal medicine. Just for you. Get rid of gooey nose faster. Also",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.512
  },
  {
   "start": 122.84,
   "end": 130.1,
   "text": "could remove inherited condition before cave baby even born. Like stop no-no hair from happen.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.512
  },
  {
   "start": 130.1,
   "end": 137.2,
   "text": "And it not just the caveman. It work on plant and creature too. Could make berry bigger.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.206,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.281
  },
  {
   "start": 137.72,
   "end": 146.44,
   "text": "Juicier. Prettier. Who could make creature bigger? Juicier. Prettier. But if so good,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.206,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.281
  },
  {
   "start": 146.94,
   "end": 153.44,
   "text": "why no happen now? Main answer ladder change possible. But still new. If cave doctor",
   "avg_logprob": -0.206,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.281
  },
  {
   "start": 153.44,
   "end": 160.54,
   "text": "play with ladder now. Bad thing could happen. Like make caveman blind. Or turn big brain caveman",
   "avg_logprob": -0.155,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.155
  },
  {
   "start": 160.54,
   "end": 168.9,
   "text": "into creative painter caveman. Who paint with own poo. Ladder change could also make designer cave",
   "avg_logprob": -0.155,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.155
  },
  {
   "start": 168.9,
   "end": 176.9,
   "text": "baby. Allow parent to choose big brain cave baby. Real strong cave baby. Or even make very very",
   "avg_logprob": -0.155,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.155
  },
  {
   "start": 176.9,
   "end": 184.48,
   "text": "handsome cave baby. Before born. Designer baby could also cost big cave money. So could mean only",
   "avg_logprob": -0.114,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.015
  },
  {
   "start": 184.48,
   "end": 191.06,
   "text": "rich caveman can have. Could cause tribe to divide into edit caveman. And normal caveman.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.114,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.015
  },
  {
   "start": 191.54,
   "end": 197.82,
   "text": "Tribe divide bad though. So me say. Why caveman play with ladder. Ladder not fun game to play.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.114,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.015
  },
  {
